<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan fisheries team visits Iran.</title>
<headline>Moroccan fisheries team visits Iran.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Officials from Morocco's Fisheries, Merchant Navy ministry and private fishing firms are visiting Iran as part of efforts to increase cooperation between the two countries, Morocco's official news agency MAP said on Sunday.</p>
<p>It said the five-day visit, which started on Saturday, focused particularly on the treatment and commercialisation of fish, on fish farms, and investment.</p>
